~ start
Danilo: Wait for me, [color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color].
=> END

~ open_phone_flashlight
do player_danilo.force_cannot_move = true
Danilo: It’s so dark... I think I need to turn on my phone’s flashlight.
- Open the phone => show_phone
=> END

~ show_phone
do Hud.reset_phone_state("07:50", "PM")
=> END

~ ising_call_danilo
Lola Ising: Iho... where are you going? It’s late... it’s dangerous outside.
=> END

~ talk_to_ising_first
Danilo: I should talk to Lola Ising first.
=> END

~ ising_give_flashlight
Danilo: I just need to do something, La... it’ll just take a moment.
Lola Ising: Iho, it’s late. Can’t it wait until tomorrow?
Danilo: I can’t wait until tomorrow... I have to go now.
Lola Ising: ...
Lola Ising: If that’s the case, take this. 
Lola Ising: Flashlight. Don’t let the path swallow you in darkness.
Danilo: ...
Danilo: Thank you, La. I’ll go first.
=> END

~ complain_phone_flashlight
Danilo: This phone flashlight is barely strong enough.
Danilo: And it’s pitch dark outside.
Danilo: If only I had a real flashlight to use...
do player_danilo.force_cannot_move = false
=> END

~ danilo_saw_ghost
Danilo: [shake rate=30 level=10]!!!![/shake]
=> END

~ ghost_gone
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]W-what... was that? I missed it. Too fast...[/shake]
Danilo: But why does it feel... like it was the one from my dreams? [shake rate=20 level=10]Was it watching me?[/shake]
=> END

~ marked_map
Danilo: Isn’t this the place marked on the map...?
Danilo: Wait, what’s on the ground?
=> END

~ picked_up_notebook
Danilo: The pages... they’re all torn.
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]???[/shake]
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]This can’t be...[/shake]
Danilo: Isn’t this... [shake rate=20 level=10][color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color][/shake]’s diary?
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]I don’t understand...[/shake]
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]How did this even end up here?[/shake]
do BuzzManager.start_buzz()
Danilo: ...
- Open the phone => open_phone
=> END

~ open_phone
do BuzzManager.stop_buzz()
do _open_phone_notifications()
=> END

~ take_meds_or_continue_looking
Danilo: It’s time to take my medication...
- Go back home to take medications => take_meds
- Continue looking for clues => continue_looking
=> END

~ take_meds
do SaveManager.took_meds("act_4_scene_1")
do SaveManager.save_moral_choice("act_4_scene_1", "relief")
Danilo: Maybe I should go home first.
Danilo: I need to take my medicine.
Danilo: But after that... I’ll continue.
Danilo: This isn’t over yet.
do _on_take_meds_chosen()
do Hud.phone_outro()
=> END

~ continue_looking
do SaveManager.missed_meds("act_4_scene_1")
do SaveManager.save_moral_choice("act_4_scene_1", "restless")
Danilo: But... if all of this is real...
Danilo: I... I won’t stop now.
Danilo: I need to find out what’s really happening.
do _on_continue_looking_chosen()
do Hud.phone_outro()
=> END

~ back_to_adventure
Danilo: I can keep going now...
=> END
